                      "name": "s2descText",
                      "fill": "#0D0D0D",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The Arias Group studies molecular mechanisms of virus-host interactions to identify conserved host-cell dependencies targetable for broad-spectrum antivirals. Using comparative virology, functional genomics screens, and pharmacological approaches, the group investigates how viruses hijack host proteostasis networks.",
